 Monastery = any of U/R/W. So I could do U from Island, U from Island, R from Mountain, R from Mystic Monastery = UURR = 4 hybrid. Yes I can activate.\n\nBut drawing 2 might be better now, especially since we have flashback Faithless Looting in grave (costs 2R) and we have mountains.\n\nLet's activate Izzet Locket.\n\nActually wait, let me see the board state more clearly. Coach has Avenger + plants (9 creatures), ESPN has Animar + Fierce Empath, Sarge has Adrix & Nev. Coach has 36 life, ESPN 30, Sarge 40. I'm at 40. Coach is the biggest threat with Avenger and tons of plants that will grow with landfall.\n\nI have Magmaquake (XRR) in hand - can wipe all creatures except flyers (Angel and Avenger are both 5/5 flyers!). Actually Avenger is ground 5/5, not flying. So Magmaquake kills Avenger (5/5) if X=4 (4 damage to each creature without flying). X=4 costs 4RR = 6 mana. I have 7 lands, so possible. Also kills all plants, Animar, Fierce Empath, Adrix & Nev.\n\nBut Coach has Khalni Heart Expedition with 2 quest counters - could sacrifice for 2 lands next turn, making plants bigger. And Aesi draws cards on landfall.\n\nActually, let's activate Izzet Locket to draw more cards, maybe find more answers or ramp.\n\nWait, I'm still in my main phase. I can activate locket before passing.\n\n",
