sponse window to my own landfall triggers. I cannot cast Cultivate right now because it's a sorcery.\n\nThe correct play here is to do nothing and let our triggers resolve. We want that card from Aesi and those counters on our plants. I am going to pass priority. No more mistakes. Let's get this right.",
