    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing Command Tower on turn 1 when there are no 1-mana plays available wastes the untapped advantage. The player has two taplands (Woodland Stream, Memorial to Genius) that could be played on turn 1 at no tempo cost, saving Command Tower for a later turn where entering untapped matters.",
